### 7\. Conclusion

The program successfully demonstrates the working of the Greedy Algorithm for currency note minimization. By selecting the largest possible denomination first and reducing the remaining amount step by step, the program calculates the required denominations and the minimum total number of notes. Thus, the Greedy Algorithm provides an efficient solution for standard Indian currency denominations.

### 8\. Important Concepts for Practical Viva

| Concept          | Explanation                                     |
| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Greedy Algorithm | Selects the best immediate option at each step. |
| Array            | Stores multiple currency denominations.         |
| For loop         | Traverses all denominations.                    |
| If condition     | Checks whether a denomination can be used.      |
| Division /       | Calculates the number of notes.                 |
