| totalNotes       | Stores the total number of notes.               |
| Time Complexity  | O(n), where n is the number of denominations.   |

Important: The greedy approach gives an optimal result for the standard denomination system used here. It is not guaranteed to give an optimal result for every possible custom set of denominations.
